## ACT No. VIII of 1992

*An Act to revoke and annual certain Bills passed by the National Assembly*

WHEREAS it is expedient to revoke and annual the Bills passed by the National Assembly on the 3rd day of May, 1992;

AND WHEREAS the National Assembly unanimously by a Resolution on May, 7, 1992, resolved to withdraw the said Bills;

It is hereby enacted as follows :—
